---
import { price } from '../facts'
import Section from './Section.astro'

const questions = [
  [
    'Do workshops need to install anything?',
    'No. They send a WhatsApp message to your number with a plate and the part they need, as a text, a photo or a voice message.',
  ],
  [
    'Who can search?',
    'The WhatsApp numbers you add as contacts, and your team from the web app. Any other number gets a reply asking them to contact you.',
  ],
  [
    'Can we search without WhatsApp?',
    'Yes. Anyone in your team starts a search from the web app with a registration plate or a VIN, and the result joins the same queue.',
  ],
  [
    'Which languages does it speak?',
    'The web app and the WhatsApp replies are available in English and Italian.',
  ],
  ['How much does it cost?', price.answer],
  [
    'Are the results a fitment guarantee?',
    'No. Results are identification guidance. Always confirm vehicle fitment before purchase.',
  ],
]
---

<Section id="questions">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start gap-x-18 gap-y-6">
    <h2 class="h2 min-w-0 flex-[1_1_18.75rem]">Questions parts sellers ask</h2>
    <div class="min-w-0 flex-[2_1_32.5rem] border-t border-dotted border-rule">
      {
        questions.map(([question, answer], index) => (
          <details open={index === 0} class="row py-4">
            <summary class="min-h-7 cursor-pointer font-heading text-xl font-bold">{question}</summary>
            <p class="mt-2.5 text-slate">{answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
